  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ara, she says to me. Her voice is quiet as a river. Ancient and knowing as a mountain. You managed to visit me. Entering",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1127
        }
      ],
      "words": 68
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Your life wasn’t destroyed by that fortune. It was made by it. You would not be here today without it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2078
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I can tell you this, at least. One was the original fortune. The second was the fortune I drew to try to change the fate",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4785
        }
      ],
      "words": 37
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Old Mother interrupts me. There’s someone else here",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5033
        }
      ],
      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Ara. I am going to will you to wake up. I believe – now our magic is stronger – I will be able to do it from my cabin. ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8825
        }
      ],
      "words": 44
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Black,” I say. “But a soft black. Like the sky on a clear night.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9557
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You are lonely. You are lonely all the time. You are strong. You are good. You go out of your way to be those things. Y",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10167
        }
      ],
      "words": 55
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“No,” he says. He motions slowly with his hand, to the hazy open space around us. A crane fly almost lands on his finger",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10777
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "My eyes fly open",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11057
        }
      ],
      "words": 4
    }
  ],
